  {"name": "rect_transform_is_ignored", "function": "bounds",
   "_comment": "TRANSFORM IS IGNORED (CORPUS_CENSUS.md 5.1) -- this and the four vectors after it carry a live `transform` and expect the UNTRANSFORMED bounds, because that is the contract: `Element::bounds` / `Element.bounds()` report the element's own coordinate space and never fold `common.transform` (jas_dioxus/src/document/evaluated_bounds.rs module docs; JasSwift/Sources/Interpreter/PropertiesPanelSync.swift lines 29-33). The transform-AWARE box the Properties panel shows is the separate `element_evaluated_bounds` family. Until these five existed every one of the 17 vectors above carried a null transform, so a port that started folding the matrix here -- silently double-applying it wherever a caller applies the CTM itself -- moved no golden. Measured on this commit: both ports return the untransformed value for all five. Expectations are the twin vector's own `expected`, copied unchanged, so no new geometry is derived here -- which matters because the live reference implements no element bounds at all (workspace_interpreter duck-types `elem.bounds()` off the frozen port's geometry, doc_primitives.py line 85). THIS vector: translate(100,50) on the rect_bounds geometry; a port that folded it would return [105,60,100,50].",
   "element": {"type": "rect", "x": 5.0, "y": 10.0, "width": 100.0, "height": 50.0, "rx": 0.0, "ry": 0.0, "fill": null, "stroke": null,
    "opacity": 1.0, "transform": {"a": 1.0, "b": 0.0, "c": 0.0, "d": 1.0, "e": 100.0, "f": 50.0}, "locked": false, "visibility": "preview"},
   "expected": [5.0, 10.0, 100.0, 50.0]},

  {"name": "ellipse_rotate_is_ignored", "function": "bounds",
   "_comment": "rotate(45) on the ellipse_bounds geometry. Non-commuting with axis-alignment, so it separates the ignore-contract from every folding rule at once: corner-mapping would give [-35.3553,35.3553,70.7107,70.7107] and a true rotated-ellipse bound [-25.4951,45.2156,50.9902,50.9902].",
   "element": {"type": "ellipse", "cx": 50.0, "cy": 50.0, "rx": 30.0, "ry": 20.0, "fill": null, "stroke": null,
    "opacity": 1.0, "transform": {"a": 0.7071067811865476, "b": 0.7071067811865476, "c": -0.7071067811865476, "d": 0.7071067811865476, "e": 0.0, "f": 0.0}, "locked": false, "visibility": "preview"},
   "expected": [20.0, 30.0, 60.0, 40.0]},

